{
  "schemaVersion": 1,
  "id": "behind-the-scenes-s01e05-scene-16",
  "pair": "zh-en",
  "title": "没资格上提案会  (Barred From the Pitch Meeting)",
  "level": "A1 — beginner",
  "labels": {
    "xingzi": "杏子",
    "chun_yuqiao": "淳于乔"
  },
  "segments": [
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "In Chun Yuqiao's office, Xingzi brings up Bu Xiaogu's new talk-show proposal, only for Yuqiao to realise who the mysterious expert behind those twenty-something questions really was. Listen to their Mandarin exchange first.",
      "gap": 0.8
    },
    {
      "v": "xingzi",
      "t": "八十页的英文合同，您这么快就看完了？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "不急。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "xingzi",
      "t": "文娱论我们已经监制了四期，算是有了点新气象。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "xingzi",
      "t": "布小谷最近很努力，做了一个策划，我觉得还挺好。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "我猜到了她要做策划，但是没想到你也参与了。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "采访对象是谁啊，这么难搞，折腾了四天了？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "我看了他提的那些问题，这个人是个高手啊。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "xingzi",
      "t": "采访对象是辛惠美，还有她的粉丝团团长。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "为什么要做这期访谈？你们做了什么交换？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "xingzi",
      "t": "没有没有，老大，他们成立了一个慈善基金，选题真的还挺好的。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "不跟我说实话可以，我的脾气你知道的，告诉外边那行政助理，她没资格上提案会。",
      "gap": 0.9
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Now let's go through it line by line with the English translation.",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "xingzi",
      "t": "八十页的英文合同，您这么快就看完了？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'An eighty-page English contract, and you finished reading it this fast?'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "不急。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'No rush.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "xingzi",
      "t": "文娱论我们已经监制了四期，算是有了点新气象。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'We have supervised four episodes of Entertainment Talk now, bringing it a fresh look.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "xingzi",
      "t": "布小谷最近很努力，做了一个策划，我觉得还挺好。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Bu Xiaogu worked hard lately and put together a proposal that I think is quite good.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "我猜到了她要做策划，但是没想到你也参与了。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'I guessed she was writing a proposal, yet I did not expect you to be involved too.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "采访对象是谁啊，这么难搞，折腾了四天了？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Who is the interview guest, being so demanding that this dragged on for four days?'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "我看了他提的那些问题，这个人是个高手啊。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'I read the questions he raised; this person is a real expert.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "xingzi",
      "t": "采访对象是辛惠美，还有她的粉丝团团长。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'The interview guests are Xin Huimei and the president of her fan club.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "为什么要做这期访谈？你们做了什么交换？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Why produce this interview episode? What trade did you make?'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "xingzi",
      "t": "没有没有，老大，他们成立了一个慈善基金，选题真的还挺好的。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Nothing at all, boss; they set up a charity fund, and the topic is genuinely strong.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "不跟我说实话可以，我的脾气你知道的，告诉外边那行政助理，她没资格上提案会。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Keep the truth from me if you wish — you know my temper; tell that admin assistant outside she is not qualified to pitch.'",
      "gap": 0.65
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Now let's listen to the whole conversation one last time.",
      "gap": 0.75
    },
    {
      "v": "xingzi",
      "t": "八十页的英文合同，您这么快就看完了？",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "不急。",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "xingzi",
      "t": "文娱论我们已经监制了四期，算是有了点新气象。",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "xingzi",
      "t": "布小谷最近很努力，做了一个策划，我觉得还挺好。",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "我猜到了她要做策划，但是没想到你也参与了。",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "采访对象是谁啊，这么难搞，折腾了四天了？",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "我看了他提的那些问题，这个人是个高手啊。",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "xingzi",
      "t": "采访对象是辛惠美，还有她的粉丝团团长。",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "为什么要做这期访谈？你们做了什么交换？",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "xingzi",
      "t": "没有没有，老大，他们成立了一个慈善基金，选题真的还挺好的。",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "不跟我说实话可以，我的脾气你知道的，告诉外边那行政助理，她没资格上提案会。",
      "gap": 0.9
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Suspecting a backroom trade, Chun Yuqiao coldly declares that an administrative assistant has no right to attend tomorrow's pitch meeting. See you next time!",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "xingzi",
      "t": "回头见！",
      "gap": 0.3
    }
  ],
